<popup window="aggdef">Agg/Def Results</popup>

<window id="aggdef" title="Agg/Def Results">
	<field name="Attack" unit="second(s)">1.2</field>
	<field name="Recharge" unit="second(s)">1.7</field>
	<field name="Init Skill">300</field>

	You must set your AGG bar at <strong>73% (6)</strong> to wield your weapon at <strong>1/1</strong>.
	(<skill id="51">Agg/def-Slider</skill> should read <strong>45</strong>).

	<section title="Init needed for max speed at">
		<field name="Full Agg (100%)" unit="inits">135</field>
		<field name="Neutral (87.5%)" unit="inits">210</field>
		<field name="Full Def (0%)" unit="inits">1170</field>
	</section>

	<slider pos="73" left="1170 DEF" right="AGG 135" marker="You: 300"/>

	Note that at the neutral position (87.5%), your attack and recharge time will match that of the weapon you are using.

	Based upon a RINGBOT module made by NoGoal(RK2)
	Modified for Budabot by Healnjoo and Nadyita
</window>
